{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/d4e066ea22f91a4dd87dad73e3d6d2a9.poster.avif?t=1759785585\" width=1170 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/d4e066ea22f91a4dd87dad73e3d6d2a9.webm?t=1759785585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/d4e066ea22f91a4dd87dad73e3d6d2a9.mp4?t=1759785585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights. Dinosaurs. Guns.</strong> Build a squad where medieval warfare meets prehistoric power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Auto-Battles.</strong> Position units, plan synergies, and watch fights unfold automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer.</strong> Battle real player teams anytime, at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Shop.</strong> Roll, merge, and upgrade to unlock higher-tier units and combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability.</strong> Try new lineups, synergies, and evolving metas every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/f1e1db5cd8b78f502a11530966da455c.poster.avif?t=1759785585\" width=1170 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/f1e1db5cd8b78f502a11530966da455c.webm?t=1759785585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com